 { Again White has a stable positional advantage, thanks to his bishop pair and control of the open file. In order to progress, Karlsson adopts a clever measure of provocation. } 1. { -KEY- } Rc5 $1 { Forcing Black to play ...b7-b6, which will expose the b-pawn to a future attack and leave a weak point on c6. } b6 ( { Perhaps } 1... Ra8 2. Ba3 Nd6 { was more solid, although it is unclear what should Black do next. } ) 
