9. Bc6 Bxb3 10. Bb5 $1 { The threat of 11 Rxb6 spells the end. } Ke7 ( { Or } 10... Bd5 11. Ba3 { with a complete paralysis of the enemy forces. } ) 
11. Ba3 Nc5 12. Rxb6 Rd1+ 13. Kh2 
